{"title": "同一句话，不同引擎（含 Edge 晓晓）", "rows": [{"lesson": "math/expressions", "key": "048d2b81", "send": "用一根蓝色长条表示 x ，一个黄色小方块表示 1 。文字可以变成图形，图形再写成代数式：“比一个数多 3”是 x 加 3 ；“一个数的 3 倍”是 3x ，也就是 3 乘 x （乘号省略不写）。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__expressions__048d2b81.mp3", "sec": 22.3, "pace": 4.24, "tries": 4, "ok": true}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__expressions__048d2b81.mp3", "sec": 23.4, "pace": 4.05, "tries": 3, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__expressions__048d2b81.mp3", "sec": 19.4, "pace": 4.87, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__expressions__048d2b81.mp3", "sec": 21.2, "pace": 4.46, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__048d2b81.mp3", "sec": 17.0, "pace": 5.56, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/expressions", "key": "4ae15f21", "send": "例题：化简 2(3x 加 1) 加 4x 。先用分配律展开： 6x 加 2 加 4x ；再合并同类项： 10x 加 2 。用 x 等于 1 检验：两种写法都等于 12 。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__expressions__4ae15f21.mp3", "sec": 19.0, "pace": 4.29, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__expressions__4ae15f21.mp3", "sec": 20.9, "pace": 3.9, "tries": 5, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__expressions__4ae15f21.mp3", "sec": 18.5, "pace": 4.4, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__expressions__4ae15f21.mp3", "sec": 20.6, "pace": 3.96, "tries": 2, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__4ae15f21.mp3", "sec": 15.7, "pace": 5.18, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/expressions", "key": "8544fb15", "send": "容易混淆：3（x + 2） 不等于 3x + 2！括号外的 3 要乘括号里的每一项，所以是 3x + 6。另外，x + 3 也不能合并成 3x：长条和小方块不是同类项。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__expressions__8544fb15.mp3", "sec": 23.6, "pace": 3.43, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__expressions__8544fb15.mp3", "sec": 19.8, "pace": 4.08, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__expressions__8544fb15.mp3", "sec": 20.6, "pace": 3.94, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__expressions__8544fb15.mp3", "sec": 21.1, "pace": 3.84, "tries": 2, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__8544fb15.mp3", "sec": 16.2, "pace": 5.0, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/expressions", "key": "974d1ffe", "send": "现在把 4 换成一个未知的长度 x 。蓝色部分变成三根 x 长条，面积是 3x ；黄色部分仍然是 6 。所以不论 x 是多少，都有 3(x 加 2) 等于 3x 加 6 。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__expressions__974d1ffe.mp3", "sec": 19.4, "pace": 4.26, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__expressions__974d1ffe.mp3", "sec": 19.5, "pace": 4.22, "tries": 5, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__expressions__974d1ffe.mp3", "sec": 19.3, "pace": 4.27, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__expressions__974d1ffe.mp3", "sec": 21.6, "pace": 3.81, "tries": 4, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__974d1ffe.mp3", "sec": 17.7, "pace": 4.66, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/expressions", "key": "991c17cd", "send": "记忆小窍门：“括号外的数要和里面每个人握手”：a 先和 b 握手，再和 c 握手，得到 ab + ac。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__expressions__991c17cd.mp3", "sec": 11.7, "pace": 4.09, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__expressions__991c17cd.mp3", "sec": 11.2, "pace": 4.27, "tries": 2, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__expressions__991c17cd.mp3", "sec": 12.7, "pace": 3.76, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__expressions__991c17cd.mp3", "sec": 11.2, "pace": 4.27, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__991c17cd.mp3", "sec": 8.9, "pace": 5.37, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/expressions", "key": "b5a3bcbd", "send": "想象一个盒子，里面装着一些弹珠。我们不知道有几颗，而且数量还可能变化： 3 、 7 、 12 ……于是给这个盒子起个名字，用一个字母比如 x 来表示。这就是用字母表示数，这个字母叫作变量。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__expressions__b5a3bcbd.mp3", "sec": 24.3, "pace": 3.84, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__expressions__b5a3bcbd.mp3", "sec": 21.7, "pace": 4.31, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__expressions__b5a3bcbd.mp3", "sec": 20.6, "pace": 4.54, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__expressions__b5a3bcbd.mp3", "sec": 22.1, "pace": 4.23, "tries": 2, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__b5a3bcbd.mp3", "sec": 18.4, "pace": 5.08, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/expressions", "key": "b8fddf17", "send": "这就是乘法分配律：括号外的数要乘括号里的每一项。同一个长方形，两种计算面积的方法： a(b 加 c) 等于 ab 加 ac", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__expressions__b8fddf17.mp3", "sec": 15.8, "pace": 3.59, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__expressions__b8fddf17.mp3", "sec": 14.1, "pace": 4.03, "tries": 4, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__expressions__b8fddf17.mp3", "sec": 13.3, "pace": 4.28, "tries": 2, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__expressions__b8fddf17.mp3", "sec": 14.9, "pace": 3.82, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__b8fddf17.mp3", "sec": 13.4, "pace": 4.24, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/expressions", "key": "bab42ff8", "send": "一旦知道盒子里是多少，就能求代数式的值。如果 x 等于 4 ，每根长条其实就有 4 个小方块那么长。数一数： 4, 8, 12 ，再 13, 14 。所以 3x 加 2 等于 3 乘 4 加 2 等于 14 。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__expressions__bab42ff8.mp3", "sec": 25.3, "pace": 4.11, "tries": 5, "ok": true}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__expressions__bab42ff8.mp3", "sec": 22.6, "pace": 4.58, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__expressions__bab42ff8.mp3", "sec": 22.2, "pace": 4.67, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__expressions__bab42ff8.mp3", "sec": 22.4, "pace": 4.63, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__bab42ff8.mp3", "sec": 18.9, "pace": 5.49, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/expressions", "key": "c5a54d4f", "send": "提取公因式就是倒过来做。把 4x 加 8 的方块排成每行都一样的长方形：高是 4 ，宽是 x 加 2 ，所以 4x 加 8 等于 4(x 加 2) 。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__expressions__c5a54d4f.mp3", "sec": 16.4, "pace": 4.43, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__expressions__c5a54d4f.mp3", "sec": 15.4, "pace": 4.7, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__expressions__c5a54d4f.mp3", "sec": 15.8, "pace": 4.58, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__expressions__c5a54d4f.mp3", "sec": 15.8, "pace": 4.61, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__c5a54d4f.mp3", "sec": 13.5, "pace": 5.38, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/expressions", "key": "cb1ecdc7", "send": "再看面积图。一个高 3 、宽 6 的长方形里有 3 乘 6 等于 18 个小方块。把它切成两块： 3 乘 4 等于 12 和 3 乘 2 等于 6 ，合起来仍然是 18 。所以 3(4 加 2) 等于 3 乘 4 加 3 乘 2 。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__expressions__cb1ecdc7.mp3", "sec": 23.7, "pace": 4.9, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__expressions__cb1ecdc7.mp3", "sec": 21.4, "pace": 5.41, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__expressions__cb1ecdc7.mp3", "sec": 20.8, "pace": 5.58, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__expressions__cb1ecdc7.mp3", "sec": 23.2, "pace": 5.0, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__cb1ecdc7.mp3", "sec": 19.4, "pace": 5.98, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/expressions", "key": "e7312f9a", "send": "同类项就是形状相同的方块。在 2x 加 3 加 x 加 1 中，把长条放在一起，小方块放在一起，得到 3x 加 4 。长条和小方块永远不能合并，因为 x 和 1 不一样大。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__expressions__e7312f9a.mp3", "sec": 19.7, "pace": 4.25, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__expressions__e7312f9a.mp3", "sec": 19.2, "pace": 4.35, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__expressions__e7312f9a.mp3", "sec": 19.1, "pace": 4.37, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__expressions__e7312f9a.mp3", "sec": 18.8, "pace": 4.45, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__e7312f9a.mp3", "sec": 16.8, "pace": 4.98, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/ratios", "key": "0323a191", "send": "1 杯蓝色要配多少黄色？把两个数都除以 2： 2比3 等于 1比1.5 。这就是单位比率：每杯蓝色配 1.5 杯黄色。有了它，什么量都好算：7 杯蓝色需要 7 乘 1.5 等于 10.5 杯黄色。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__ratios__0323a191.mp3", "sec": 22.4, "pace": 4.38, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__ratios__0323a191.mp3", "sec": 22.7, "pace": 4.31, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__ratios__0323a191.mp3", "sec": 21.8, "pace": 4.5, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__ratios__0323a191.mp3", "sec": 22.7, "pace": 4.31, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__0323a191.mp3", "sec": 18.3, "pace": 5.36, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/ratios", "key": "187e9fbf", "send": "把每一对数画成点（蓝色， 黄色）。等价的比全都落在同一条过原点的直线上：每向右 2 格，就向上 3 格。每一对的比值都是 2分之3 等于 1.5 ，也就是单位比率。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__ratios__187e9fbf.mp3", "sec": 20.0, "pace": 4.1, "tries": 2, "ok": true}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__ratios__187e9fbf.mp3", "sec": 20.5, "pace": 4.0, "tries": 4, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__ratios__187e9fbf.mp3", "sec": 19.0, "pace": 4.31, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__ratios__187e9fbf.mp3", "sec": 18.6, "pace": 4.42, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__187e9fbf.mp3", "sec": 15.6, "pace": 5.26, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/ratios", "key": "43d28235", "send": "单位比率能帮你购物。A 店 3 本笔记本卖 7.50 美元；B 店 5 本卖 11 美元。算出一本的价格：A 是 7.50 除以 3 等于 2.50 ，B 是 11 除以 5 等于 2.20 。B 店更划算。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__ratios__43d28235.mp3", "sec": 25.8, "pace": 3.91, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__ratios__43d28235.mp3", "sec": 22.4, "pace": 4.51, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__ratios__43d28235.mp3", "sec": 21.2, "pace": 4.76, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__ratios__43d28235.mp3", "sec": 22.3, "pace": 4.53, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__43d28235.mp3", "sec": 18.3, "pace": 5.52, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/ratios", "key": "44e4c72c", "send": "容易混淆：要得到等价的比，两个数必须同时乘（或除以）同一个数。给两个数加上同一个数（比如 2:3，3:4）会改变它们的关系——颜料的颜色就变了。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__ratios__44e4c72c.mp3", "sec": 17.4, "pace": 4.15, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__ratios__44e4c72c.mp3", "sec": 21.2, "pace": 3.4, "tries": 3, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__ratios__44e4c72c.mp3", "sec": 18.0, "pace": 4.0, "tries": 3, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__ratios__44e4c72c.mp3", "sec": 16.8, "pace": 4.29, "tries": 2, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__44e4c72c.mp3", "sec": 14.7, "pace": 4.9, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/ratios", "key": "5cc0f84f", "send": "把线段图拉长成双数轴：上面是蓝色，下面是黄色。每跳一格就多调一份：多 2 杯蓝色、3 杯黄色。上下对齐的两个数，调出来的都是同样的绿色。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__ratios__5cc0f84f.mp3", "sec": 17.0, "pace": 4.01, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__ratios__5cc0f84f.mp3", "sec": 16.1, "pace": 4.23, "tries": 1, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__ratios__5cc0f84f.mp3", "sec": 15.8, "pace": 4.29, "tries": 3, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__ratios__5cc0f84f.mp3", "sec": 16.2, "pace": 4.19, "tries": 2, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__5cc0f84f.mp3", "sec": 15.2, "pace": 4.47, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/ratios", "key": "7359dda8", "send": "颜料不够？再调