"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__ratios__ca9acc64.mp3", "sec": 13.0, "pace": 4.52, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__ratios__ca9acc64.mp3", "sec": 14.5, "pace": 4.07, "tries": 2, "ok": true}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__ratios__ca9acc64.mp3", "sec": 13.4, "pace": 4.42, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__ratios__ca9acc64.mp3", "sec": 14.8, "pace": 3.99, "tries": 2, "ok": true}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__ca9acc64.mp3", "sec": 11.4, "pace": 5.18, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/ratios", "key": "f5678906", "send": "在比例表里，把 2比3 的两个数都乘 4，得到 8比12 ：形状不变，还是同样的绿色。可如果给两个数都加 4，得到 6比7 ：黄色不再是蓝色的 1.5 倍，颜色就变了！", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/4b__math__ratios__f5678906.mp3", "sec": 18.6, "pace": 4.51, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "HF 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/8b__math__ratios__f5678906.mp3", "sec": 18.2, "pace": 4.61, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang__math__ratios__f5678906.mp3", "sec": 18.1, "pace": 4.65, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "SGLang 8B + 参考原文": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.io/gc-audio-lang-math/_listen/engines/sglang-rt__math__ratios__f5678906.mp3", "sec": 16.6, "pace": 5.05, "tries": 5, "ok": false}, "Edge 晓晓（原文，不转换）": {"src": "edge/XiaoxiaoNeural__f5678906.mp3", "sec": 15.6, "pace": 5.38, "tries": 1, "ok": true}}}, {"lesson": "math/ratios", "key": "f84c8ea9", "send": "例题：一辆汽车 3 小时行驶 150 英里。5 小时能行驶多远？先求 1 小时的路程： 150 除以 3 等于 50 英里/时，再放大： 5 乘 50 等于 250 英里。", "target": 3.8, "takes": {"HF 4B": {"src": "https://gladcolor.github.i